@startuml "Feedback Create AI Sequence"
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
actor "Sinh viên" as Student
participant "Giao diện" as FE
participant "FeedbackController" as FC
participant "FeedbackService" as FS
participant "OpenAI Service" as AI
participant "FeedbackDAO" as FDAO
database "CSDL" as DB

Student -> FE: Nhập phản ánh
FE -> FC: POST /api/feedbacks
FC -> FS: createFeedback(data, userId)
FS -> FDAO: INSERT feedback
FDAO -> DB: INSERT feedbacks
DB --> FDAO: OK
FS -> AI: analyzeFeedback(content)
AI --> FS: sentiment/priority
FS -> FDAO: updateAIResult(id, result)
FDAO -> DB: UPDATE feedbacks
DB --> FDAO: OK
FC --> FE: 201 Created
@enduml
